Bucket word pack

The word lessons in bkt use words, definitions, IPA and etymology from
Wiktionary (https://en.wiktionary.org), taken from the Kaikki extract
(https://kaikki.org). Wiktionary text is the work of its contributors and is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
licence (CC-BY-SA 3.0).

Changes made by Bucket: the pack leaves out entries that only point to
another word, and keeps one short definition and up to four further senses
for each word, one pronunciation, and a shortened etymology. Each word links to its full entry
on Wiktionary.

Bucket offers the changed word list, packages/bkt/content/words.json, under
the same licence. The full licence text is in licences/CC-BY-SA-3.0.txt, and
bkt licences prints it.
